Sudden update and discount! Happy Halloween to you!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43079794/4824336313ca7bcc632c2ceac9a5bf4297f350c4.png

▪ The game has been ported to the new, latest version of the engine; 
▪ Updated all technical aspects of the game: 
▪ This will allow us to keep our finger on the pulse in the future and respond more quickly to challenges.

▪ Fixed a rare crash in puzzles that occurred when performing a certain sequence of actions;
▪ Fixed a bug that allowed you to pass puzzles in an unfair way, using the flaws of the pause;
▪ Fixed the mechanism for switching windowed and fullscreen mode;
▪ Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance.


■ Discounts for the whole week up to 90%! Hurry up to buy the game at a bargain price:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010320

We made a few changes for the sake of the players from Germany and China:
• The achievement for installing the free DLC has been completely removed. Unfortunately this DLC is not available in Germany and China;
• Added a new achievement available to the whole world: View any TOP 5 players on the level selection screen;
• All other players should not worry! You don't need to get a new achievement again if you have already opened them all.

Other fixes:
• Fixed a bug when an achievement was given on the settings screen;
• Japanese language: improved display of TOP-5 results;
• Correction of windowed / fullscreen switching modes;
• Improved gamepad support;
• Fixes and improvements aimed at improving stability and performance;
• Improved music mixing. You won't hear the silence anymore =)

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2010320

